  <item>
    <title>2504.✨不停止，不循环｜聊聊在职、离职、大龄考研</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67931c9b247d51713cfb3904</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67931c9b247d51713cfb3904</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jan 2025 04:58:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「👇本期简介」</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客邀请了一名北京师范大学学科数学的‌π学长，分享他从</span><strong><span>在职考研到离职考研</span></strong><span>、从</span><strong><span>新东方数学老师到秋招上岸公立学校</span></strong><span>的跨专业备考、离职备考、职业选择的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客将深入探讨跨考教育学、在职备考和年龄焦虑等话题，希望为同样处在类似阶段的朋友们提供一些启发和鼓励。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「▶️快速进入」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:00:18</a>:嘉宾介绍，个人经历概述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">00:02:20</a>:本期话题聚焦、简单概述</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>「part1」Q&amp;A 聊聊跨考、离职备考期间的故事</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">00:03:13</a>: &nbsp;1️⃣为什么从金融跨考到教育？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">00:04:07</a>: 2️⃣为什么本科从财经院校毕业入职新东方后又选择离职？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">00:06:28</a>: 3️⃣你觉得在职考研的挑战有哪些？你是怎么克服的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">00:10:19</a>: 总结离职备考的压力：二次职业选择、经济问题、工作学习的平衡</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「part2」Q&amp;A 聊聊上岸之后的故事</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">00:13:15</a>: 4️⃣回忆自己当时拿到录取通知书的时候，是什么感觉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">00:16:34</a>: ❓</span><strong><span>现实vs理想：</span></strong><span>学硕or专硕怎么选择，在读期间的收获与感悟。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">00:19:27</a>:5️⃣对自己未来职业画像和预期是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">00:20:13</a>: ❓</span><strong><span>机构vs学校：</span></strong><span>从培训机构讲师转变到公立学校老师，如何完成身份转变？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">00:26:08</a>: 🔍到底是否要二战三战、辞职考研？</span><strong><span>必要性、重要性和可行性分析</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">00:31:29</a>: ⌛年龄焦虑：大龄考生的备考压力与现实挑战</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「part3」总结&amp;祝福：人间四月芳菲尽，山寺桃花始盛开</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2293">00:38:13</a>: ⭐如何对抗现实的年龄焦虑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">00:45:34</a>: ❤祝福大家不停止、不循环；走向更好的自己</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>🎵Bgm：Perfect-Edsheeran</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><em><span>🎵</span></em><em><strong><span>Bgm：我想当风-鹿先森乐队</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>🎉新年快要到啦！不知道大家有没有发现我们的新年特别主题的封面呀~！</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>🎇祝大家巳巳如意，生生不息！我们，年后见~</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🌈 ✨ 🌈 ✨ 🌈 ✨🌈 ✨ 🌈 ✨ 🌈 ✨ 🌈 ✨ 🌈 ✨🌈 ✨ 🌈 ✨</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>主播🎙️：山海、π学长</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>剪辑🎧：饼干</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>公众号👸：浣熊山海教育学</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>微博、小红书：@教育学山海</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676fb4141e823e72d36ba2a8/ljIRb-5NGA3tmqwmNYIgRIhNO8WQ.m4a" length="72352400" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhjeNLh36sTIICQgN3Qp3DWYPJ3L.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>2504</itunes:episode>
